# Supabase credentials for the optional learning-log backup.
#
# On Vercel these are injected by the official Supabase Marketplace integration
# and there is nothing to set by hand. Copy them here only for local development.
#
# NEVER commit the real values. The repository is public; the secret key grants
# full, RLS-bypassing access to the project.
#
# SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY is the modern name. Older projects were provisioned with
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, which the API still accepts as a fallback.
#
# The publishable/anon key is deliberately NOT usable here: the table has Row
# Level Security on with no public policy, so an anon key would produce a backup
# that reports success and stores nothing. The API refuses it and says so.
#
# Without these the app runs entirely offline-first and the backup control is
# hidden — no database is a supported configuration, not an error.
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=sb_secret_replace_me
